<title>EGYPT: SQUASH-NICOL WINS AL-AHRAM CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-NICOL WINS AL-AHRAM CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of the finals of the al-Ahram International Squash Championship played in Cairo on Tuesday:</p>
<p>Men's</p>
<p>3-Peter Nicol (Scotland) beat 1-Jansher Khan (Pakistan) 12-15 15-14 15-12 15-11</p>
<p>Women's</p>
<p>Sarah Fitz-Gerald (Australia) beat Michelle Martin (Australia) 9-3 9-3 9-0</p>
</text>
